# Copy to .env.local (never committed) and restart `npm run dev` after editing.

# Reads recipe photos, PDFs and links, and fact-checks each new recipe.
# Without it, photos queue in data/inbox and you run `npm run transcribe`
# (or ask Claude Code to transcribe them). Key: https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: send the shopping list to a Kroger-family cart (King Soopers,
# Kroger, Ralphs, Fred Meyer…). Register an app at https://developer.kroger.com
# with this redirect URI and the scopes product.compact, cart.basic:write and
# profile.compact. Set your banner in lib/home.js.
# KROGER_CLIENT_ID=
# KROGER_CLIENT_SECRET=
# KROGER_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3001/api/kroger/callback

# Optional: where the Codex CLI lives, if not /opt/homebrew/bin/codex. Codex
# draws the illustrated card pictures; without it cards keep their SVG art.
# CODEX_BIN=
